ist:\n\n(1,1)\n(1,2)\n(1,3)\n(1,4)\n(2,1)\n(2,2)\n(2,3)\n(3,1)\n(3,2)\n(4,1)\n\nCompute slopes:\n\n- Pair (1,1)-(2,2): slope = (2-1)/(2-1) = 1 (sunny)\n- (1,1)-(3,3): (3-1)/(3-1) = 1, but (3,3) not in S_4 (3+3=6>5). So not relevant.\n- (1,1)-(4,4): not in S_4.\n- (1,1)-(2,3): slope = (3-1)/(2-1) = 2 (sunny)\n- (1,1)-(3,2): slope = (2-1)/(3-1) = 1/2 (sunny)\n- (1,1)-(4,1): slope = (1-1)/(4-1) = 0 (horizontal, not sunny)\n- (1,1)-(3,1): slope = 0 (horizontal)\n- (1,1)-(2,1): slope = 0 (horizontal)\n- (1,1)-(1,2): vertical (∞)\n- (1,1)-(1,3): vertical\n- (1,1)-(1,4): vertical\n\n- (1,2)-(2,1): slope = (1-2)/(2-1) = -1 (not sunny)\n- (1,2)-(2,2): slope = (2-2)/(2-1) = 0 (horizontal)\n- (1,2)-(2,3): slope = (3-2)/(2-1) = 1 (sunny)\n- (1,2)-(3,1): slope = (1-2)/(3-1) = -1/2 (sunny)\n- (1,2)-(3,2): slope = (2-2)/(3-1) = 0 (horizontal)\n- (1,2)-(3,3): not in S_4\n- (1,2)-(4,1): slope = (1-2)/(4-1) = -1/3 (sunny)\n- (1,2)-(4,2): not in S_4\n- (1,2)-(2,4): not in S_4\n- (1,2)-(2,5): not in S_4\n\n- (1,3)-(2,1): slope = (1-3)/(2-1) = -2 (sunny)\n- (1,3)-(2,2): slope = (2-3)/(2-1) = -1 (not sunny)\n- (1,3)-(2,3): slope = (3-3)/(2-1) = 0 (horizontal)\n- (1,3)-(3,1): slope = (1-3)/(3-1) = -1 (not sunny)\n- (1,3)-(3,2): slope = (2-3)/(3-1) = -1/2 (sunny)\n- (1,3)-(3,3): not in S_4\n- (1,3)-(4,1): slope = (1-3)/(4-1) = -2/3 (sunny)\n- (1,3)-(4,2): not in S_4\n- (1,3)-(4,3): not in S_4\n\n- (1,4)-(2,1): slope = (1-4)/(2-1) = -3 (sunny)\n- (1,4)-(2,2): slope = (2-4)/(2-1) = -2 (sunny)\n- (1,4)-(2,3): slope = (3-4)/(2-1) = -1 (not sunny)\n- (1,4)-(3,1): slope = (1-4)/(3-1) = -3/2 (sunny)\n- (1,4)-(3,2): slope = (2-4)/(3-1) = -1 (not sunny)\n- (1,4)-(3,3): not in S_4\n- (1,4)-(4,1): slope = (1-4)/(4-1) = -1 (not sunny)\n- (1,4)-(4,2): not in S_4\n\n- (2,1)-(3,2): slope = (2-1)/(3-2) = 1 (sunny)\n- (2,1)-(4,1): slope = 0 (horizontal)\n- (2,1)-(3,1): slope = 0 (horizontal)\n- (2,1)-(2,2): vertical\n- (2,1)-(2,3): vertical\n- (2,1)-(1,2): slope = (2-1)/(1-2) = -1 (not sunny)\n- (2,1)-(1,3